{"4786060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Primal Tactica", "steam_appid": 4786060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/398ceee789e591a369becd0f750088a3.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Tactica is a roguelike autobattler where you build a team to push back the corruption consuming the land. Roll and evolve a roster of 200+ Primals, stack their synergies, and equip them with Augments and Relics — then position your team and watch them fight. With a roster this deep, no two runs come together the same way, and there's always another build to chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/73df3f8255839939993c73693e95aa52.poster.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/73df3f8255839939993c73693e95aa52.webm?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/73df3f8255839939993c73693e95aa52.mp4?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/c9b3d2647bb7b0f5f0b94b9c0b35b174.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources carefully: every roll is a bet on the Primals you need right now versus the ones you're hoping to evolve later. Between fights you'll pick your way across a branching map, weighing the safe route against the one guarded by something nasty. The richest rewards sit behind the toughest defenders — the only way to earn that power is to be strong enough to take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/47fb723c824660e5ff8899e2dd72ecc5.poster.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1170 height=890 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/47fb723c824660e5ff8899e2dd72ecc5.webm?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/47fb723c824660e5ff8899e2dd72ecc5.mp4?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/709354d07424518bd240300484097382.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match three of a kind to evolve a Primal into a stronger form —  the best builds chain those evolutions again and again. Each attempt is a self-contained run: climb as far as your team can carry you, and when it falls, start over and chase a better one. Autobattler team-building meets roguelike's one-more-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/60948f798d891f648b3cde1c871034e7.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Primals, each evolving into stronger forms with their own abilities, strengths, and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Relics with run-altering, team-wide effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Augments that rebuild individual Primals with new skills, stats, and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack synergies into builds that break the game wide open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb escalating difficulties that reward sharp decisions and bold experimentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a new team every run, and chase the elusive god run — where your team spirals into absurd, godlike power</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/3eabee19bf57f50bea767b00f009e2ee.poster.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/3eabee19bf57f50bea767b00f009e2ee.webm?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/398ceee789e591a369becd0f750088a3.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Tactica is a roguelike autobattler where you build a team to push back the corruption consuming the land. Roll and evolve a roster of 200+ Primals, stack their synergies, and equip them with Augments and Relics — then position your team and watch them fight. With a roster this deep, no two runs come together the same way, and there's always another build to chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/73df3f8255839939993c73693e95aa52.poster.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/73df3f8255839939993c73693e95aa52.webm?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/73df3f8255839939993c73693e95aa52.mp4?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/c9b3d2647bb7b0f5f0b94b9c0b35b174.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources carefully: every roll is a bet on the Primals you need right now versus the ones you're hoping to evolve later. Between fights you'll pick your way across a branching map, weighing the safe route against the one guarded by something nasty. The richest rewards sit behind the toughest defenders — the only way to earn that power is to be strong enough to take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/47fb723c824660e5ff8899e2dd72ecc5.poster.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1170 height=890 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/47fb723c824660e5ff8899e2dd72ecc5.webm?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/47fb723c824660e5ff8899e2dd72ecc5.mp4?t=1788319794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/709354d07424518bd240300484097382.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match three of a kind to evolve a Primal into a stronger form —  the best builds chain those evolutions again and again. Each attempt is a self-contained run: climb as far as your team can carry you, and when it falls, start over and chase a better one. Autobattler team-building meets roguelike's one-more-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/60948f798d891f648b3cde1c871034e7.avif?t=1788319794\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Primals, each evolving into stronger forms with their own abilities, strengths, and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Relics with run-altering, team-wide effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Augments that rebuild individual Primals with new skills, stats, and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack synergies into builds that break the game wide open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb escalating difficulties that reward sharp decisions and bold experimentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a new team every run, and chase the elusive god run — where your team spirals into absurd, godlike power</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786060/extras/3eabee19bf57f50bea767b00f009e2ee.